reagent-name-tranexamic-acid-plus = concentrated tranexamic acid
reagent-desc-tranexamic-acid-plus = A high-potency blood-clotting agent that slows bleeding and stabilizes patients in critical condition. Also helps shake off stuns and knockdowns.

reagent-name-antigrippin = antigrippin
reagent-desc-antigrippin = Antiviral tablets specifically for space cold. May cause mild drowsiness. Does not treat flu, bird flew, or vent cough.
